  "Question": "In right triangle \\(ABC\\), \\(\\angle C=90^\\circ\\), \\(BC=6\\), and \\(\\tan A=3/4\\). Find the lengths of \\(AC\\) and \\(AB\\). (Give your answers in this order, separated by a comma.)",
